<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglo appoints new mining business chief.</title>
<headline>Anglo appoints new mining business chief.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd said on Tuesday it had appointed Robert Danchin as the chairman of the corporation's New Mining Business Division.</p>
<p>Danchin will succeed Alan McKerron, who has retired, with effect from October 1, Anglo said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482 1003</p>
</text>
